{"id":"n40143-2-8","stage":4,"title":"노리다 · 伺机 ","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40143-2-8-1","ko":"이번 시험에서 또 떨어졌어요.","zh":"这次考试我又没及格啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에서","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에서","audio":"/audio/03bc4310d38533975076.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌어요.","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌어요","audio":"/audio/d750985f484c425ae8e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd466f842b1d9b494f52.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40143-2-8-2","ko":"괜찮으니까 다음 기회를 노려 보자.","zh":"没关系，我们再争取下一次的机会吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮으니까","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮으니까","audio":"/audio/f0cf1bae09fbe7c7c620.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"기회를","meaning":"机会，机遇，时机","explanation":"기회：机会，机遇，时机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기회","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기회를","audio":"/audio/ba41e46d6c114f2b02f2.mp3"}},{"text":"노려","meaning":"伺机 ，等，欲要","explanation":"노리다：伺机 ，等，欲要；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"노리다","audio":"/audio/38fc71f9a1fe362fbce0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40143","senseId":"2","lemma":"노리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노려","audio":"/audio/d370fbe1c5b58d00188f.mp3"}},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자","audio":"/audio/0434c803cb8571c9cf8e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다